title: "id-tamper-check: Explainable ID card tampering detection with SSIM and OpenCV"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python tool and library that aligns a candidate photo of an identity document to a trusted
  reference, computes a structural similarity (SSIM) map, and highlights edited regions such as altered dates,
  numbers, and portraits.
